{"id":"wb-6-780","name":"北营庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北营庙","text":"北营庙位于中国陕西省渭南韩城市古城历史文化街区的西侧，金城街道金城大街258号（北段西侧），是一座关帝庙，始建于金代，因此地原设有驻兵营房北营而得名。北营庙是韩城古城的五营庙之一，距离五营庙中的另一处东营庙（陕西省文物保护单位）不足500米。北营庙已列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E8%90%A5%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94248261,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94248261","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/aa51ccd9953ef36873d2e32f.jpg","title":"Beiying_Temple_05_2013-09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beiying_Temple_05_2013-09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/Beiying_Temple_05_2013-09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​韩城北营庙，自西南侧看献殿。","width":320,"height":240}}